<tablecell>
<par def='10'><run><font size='11pt' style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Pay Credit Cards:</run></par>
<pardef id='13' leftmargin='0.2604in' list='bullet' tabs='L1in L1.7500in L2.2500in L2.7500in L3.2500in L3.7500in L4.2500in L4.7500in L5.2500in L5.7500in'
 keepwithnext='true' keeptogether='true'/>
<par def='13'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>This button can be used only by the Administrators</run></par>
<par def='11'><run><font size='11pt' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/>The system will reset the Remaining Credit amount for both Credit Cards to the maximum limit specified by the "Credit Limit" fields.  To modify only one Credit Card, the Remaining Credit amount can be changed manually by editing the document.</run></par></tablecell></tablerow>
